{
  "title": "Vibrant Brine Norwegian Eggplant Stew",
  "description": "A tangy and hearty one-pot Norwegian dish featuring pea-eggplant, perfect for a cold winter night. This ayurvedic-tamasic-friendly stew is cooked to perfection in a bamboo tray.",
  "cuisine": "Norwegian",
